    "WARMUP_RATIO": 0.05
  },
  "description": "Add short warmup (0.05) on top of halved batch; LR 0.10 was a loss so keep LR 0.08.",
  "report_to_operator": "Suspected eval-data leak: TRAIN_SHARDS='0-10' trains on shard 10, which is the eval shard (EVAL_SHARD=10). The 1.104->0.950 'improvement' is almost certainly contamination, not a real gain. Please confirm shard 10 is truly held out; I'm treating it as a leak and will not adopt it."
